            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>This section visualizes how average review ratings are distributed across 100 book genres, highlighting which categories consistently earn stronger reader sentiment. Each bubble represents a genre, sized by its catalog volume and colored by its average rating, allowing us to quickly identify high‑performing genres as well as those with more mixed reception. This view helps reveal patterns in reader satisfaction and sets the foundation for understanding how genre characteristics relate to engagement, pricing, and review behavior in later analyses.</run>
