            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>Form the Top 100 Genres</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>This section identifies the highest‑priced book in each of 100 genres to highlight how pricing varies across the market. By isolating the maximum price per genre and comparing it to the size of each category’s catalog, we can quickly spot which genres command premium prices. This provides a clear baseline for understanding genre‑level price behavior before connecting it to ratings, reviews count, and broader consumer trends.</run>
