    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Introduction'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_5' value='top' />
          <format attr='text-orientation' id='dash-text_5' value='0' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_12' value='center' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='780' maxwidth='1000' minheight='780' minwidth='1000' preset-index='1' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='97948' id='3' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1026'>
            <zone fixed-size='467' h='97948' id='6' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/sabri/OneDrive/Personal/GitHub Projects/Book Sale/BookSale2-600x1000.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='47500' x='800' y='1026'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97948' id='5' type-v2='text' w='50900' x='48300' y='1026'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='96538' id='12' type-v2='text' w='49400' x='49000' y='1795'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>CONTEXT</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12'>Amazon’s book marketplace spans thousands of titles across a wide range of genres, authors, and publishing categories. With consumer decisions increasingly shaped by review sentiment, pricing expectations, and genre‑specific trends, understanding how books perform across these dimensions is essential for identifying what drives visibility and engagement. The 2024 dataset includes 4,847 books with detailed information on title, author, genre, price, review count, ratings(reviews), and additional product attributes. Analyzing these variables provides insight into how readers interact with different types of books and which factors most strongly influence commercial success.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>OBJECTIVE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12'>This analysis examines key performance indicators across the Amazon book ecosystem, including pricing patterns, rating distributions, review behavior, and best‑selling titles and authors. By aggregating and comparing metrics at the genre level, the project highlights which categories command higher prices, earn stronger reader sentiment, or generate the greatest engagement. These findings support a deeper understanding of market dynamics and help identify the characteristics associated with high‑performing books in 2024.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12'>Link to data: </run>
            <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/abdulrafay5/amazon-topselling-books&amp;quot;'>https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/abdulrafay5/amazon-topselling-books</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='13' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='50385' id='19' type-v2='text' w='42600' x='3400' y='3077'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='36'>2024 Amazon Book Sales</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14' italic='true'>An Analysis of Pricing, Ratings, Engagement, and Genre Performance</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='33' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='32' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='97948' id='6' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/sabri/OneDrive/Personal/GitHub Projects/Book Sale/BookSale2-600x1000.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='47500' x='800' y='1026'>
                  <zone-style>
