            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>This section explores how reader sentiment (average review ratings) relates to overall engagement (total review count) across 100 book genres. Each point represents a genre, allowing us to identify categories that attract large audiences, those that earn consistently high ratings, and those that perform well on both dimensions. By comparing popularity and perceived quality side‑by‑side, this view helps reveal which genres resonate most strongly with readers and which may have high visibility but more mixed reception.</run>
