            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>This section highlights the top 50 best‑selling books and authors by comparing total review counts across genres. By visualizing titles and authors side‑by‑side, we can quickly identify which works generate the most reader engagement and which authors maintain broad popularity. Genre‑based color coding adds context, helping connect commercial success to broader category trends.</run>
